!.github/docker/**

# Exclude generated files and private copies even inside source directories.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/runtime
**/runtime/**
**/vendor
**/vendor/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/backup
**/backup/**
**/backups
**/backups/**
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*.old
**/*.orig
**/*.log
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.sql.gz
